said section sentenced to suffer simple imprisonment for a 
period of 06(six) months and also to pay a fine of 
Tk.11,00,000/- (eleven lac) by his judgment and order of 
conviction and sentence dated 14.01.2021 rightly.   
Considering the above facts and circumstances and 
materials on record, it is my view that the prosecution is able to 
establish the case and thus succeeded in proving it beyond all 
reasonable doubts. Therefore, the learned Sessions Judge, 
chandpur passed the judgment and order of conviction and 
sentence dated 14.01.2021 in Sessions Case No.182 of 2020 
