Mr. Mohammad Mohsin Kabir, the learned Advocate 
appearing on behalf of the complainant-respondent No.1(c) 
submits that the appellant has taken money from the 
complainant. Subsequently, he paid some cash money and 
issued a cheque amount of Tk.6,50,000/- cheque No.5111228. 
The appellant issued the dispute cheque from the National 
