an allegation of misappropriation amounting to Taka 1,59,00,000/= only against 
them. With this regard, an Investigating Committee was formed to investigate 
into the matter and after conclusion of the Investigation, the committee 
submitted a report and on the basis of that report respondent No.4 passed an 
