/culprits as soon as possible, preferable within 30(thirty) days from the date of 
receipt of the order, in accordance with law, without fail. If the enquiry 
committee found any member of the Project Implementation Committee or any 
officials of Viqarunnisa Noon School and College are involved with 
misappropriation of Viqarunnisa Noon School and College fund, then the 
respondents No.4 is at liberty to take necessary steps against the real 
perpetrators/culprits instantly, in accordance with law.

Let the order of stay granted at the time of issuance of the Rule stands 
vacated. 
There is no Order as to cost. 
Communicate the order at once.

Khizir Hayat, J, 
I agree.

A.K. Azad/BO","PETITIONERs are persons who contested the 2022 election to the governing body of the Viqarunnisa Noon School and College as general guardian members, and who complain about the declaration of three others as elected and about the way the institution's development works were carried out. RESPONDENTs are the ministry of education, the Board of Intermediate and Secondary Education at Dhaka and the school authorities. They ask for action on their representation and for an enquiry into the irregularities they allege.","Other: Secondary and Higher Secondary Education Board, Dhaka (Governing Body and Managing Committee) Regulations, 2009",PARTLY,"The court found that the two enquiry reports produced before it were perfunctory: nineteen development works had been started without a single tender notice or work order and were never finished, and the persons who benefited had not been identified. It declined, however, to make a declaration about the election itself and instead left the matter to the statutory authority. The chairman of the board was directed to dispose of the representation and to constitute a high powered enquiry within thirty days.",5454099bbc15beb34a24a3b4d6f11861310696d04ad6d6a577ab245b9406d6d8
