Sheikh Abdul Awal, J: 
This Appeal at the instance of convict appellant, 
Mst. Mumtaz Begum is directed against the judgment 
and order of conviction and sentence dated 09.02.2020 
passed by the learned Additional Sessions Judge, Natore 
in Sessions Case No. 1036 of 2018 arising out of C.R. 
Case No. 145 of 2018 (Lal) convicting the appellant 
under section 138 of the Negotiable Instruments Act, 

