<<PAGE 1>>
Present 
Mr. Justice Sheikh Abdul Awal 
Criminal Appeal No. 4883 of 2018 
 
 
 
 
Md. Khatub Uddin alias Khotob 
..........Convict-appellant. 
-Versus- 
The State                          .....Respondent. 
 
Ms. Nusrat Yeasmin, Advocate 
.....For the appellant. 
