Rwg Rwg`v‡ii Lvm `L‡j _vKv Ae¯’vq e‡›`ve‡¯Zi Ki‡j Avqbv‡ji 
mv‡_ wM‡qwQjvg| Avgvi Avg‡jB e‡›`ve¯Z n‡qwQj| 27 UvKv 
