submitted the report on 17.02.2002 stating that as on 06.02.2002 the required 
stock of the pledge and hypo jute were valued at Tk. 55,86,000 and there was 
stock of jute valued at Tk. 6,93,363 and there was shortage of jute (hypo) 
valued at Tk. 1,99,000 of jute total value at Tk. 55,92,000. Again the 
Divisional Office of Sonali Bank, Khulna by office order dated 15.05.2002 
formed a 04 members inquiry committee headed by P.W. 8 and P.Ws. 2, 9 
and 10 were the members of the said committee. The said 4 members team in 
